<div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="card shadow border-0 mt-3">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 mb-4 text-center" style="color: #002b80;">
                <h4>Welcome to the Topeka Mustang Club Inc.</h4>
                <p>(Since 1981)</p>
            </div>
        </div>        
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-3">
                <a class="navbar-brand" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index"><img width="120px" src="~/images/tmci_logo.png" /></a>
            </div>
            <div class="col-9 text-md-start">
                <p>The Topeka Mustang Club, Inc. is a group of automotive enthusiasts dedicated to the preservation, care, and enjoyment of Mustangs from the 64 1/2 to the present day models.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-11 text-md-start ms-3 me-4 mb-3 mt-3">
                <p>TMC is managed by a board of directors and members, all of which are from different parts of the Topeka and Northeast Kansas area.  TMC has been around since it was founded in August 1981. We have members with Mustangs from 1965 through 2020, coupes, convertibles, Fastbacks, and Shelby’s. We became a Regional Club of Mustang Club of America in January of 2018. TMC also welcomes members with all types of Ford vehicles.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
